[{"title":"一剪梅","author":"唐寅","text":"雨打梨花深闭门。\n孤负青春，虚负青春。\n赏心乐事共谁论。\n花下销魂，月下销魂。\n愁聚眉峰尽日颦。\n千点啼痕，万点啼痕。\n晓看天色暮看云。\n行也思君，坐也思君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":942,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一剪梅","author":"唐寅","text":"红满苔阶绿满枝。\n杜宇声声，杜宇声悲。\n交欢未久又分离。\n彩凤孤飞，彩凤孤栖。\n别后相思是几时。\n后会难知，后会难期。\n此情何以表相思。\n一首情词，一首情诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":943,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"句","author":"唐寅","text":"此生甘兮走昊阊，辱皆无剩有狂。\n百年障眼书千卷，四海资身笔一枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":944,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别云间","author":"夏完淳","text":"三年羁旅客，今日又南冠。\n无限山河泪，谁言天地宽！\n已知泉路近，欲别故乡难。\n毅魄归来日，灵旗空际看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":945,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"夏完淳","text":"复楚情何极，亡秦气未平。\n雄风清角劲，落日大旗明。\n缟素酬家国，戈船决死生！\n胡笳千古恨，一片月临城。\n战苦难酬国，仇深敢忆家。\n一身存汉腊，满目尽胡沙。\n落月翻旗影，清霜冷剑花。\n六军浑散尽，半夜起悲笳。\n一旅同仇谊，三秋故主怀。\n将星沉左辅，卿月隐中台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":946,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"夏完淳","text":"扁舟明月两峰间，千顷芦花人未还。\n缥缈苍茫不可接，白云空翠洞庭山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":947,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"精卫","author":"夏完淳","text":"北风荡天地，有鸟鸣空林。\n志长羽翼短，衔石随浮沈。\n崇山日以高，沧海日以深。\n愧非补天匹，延颈振哀音。\n辛苦徒自力，慷慨谁为心？\n滔滔东逝波，劳劳成古今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":948,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寻芳草 别恨","author":"夏完淳","text":"几阵杜鹃啼，却在那，杏花深处。\n小禽儿，唤得人归去，唤不得愁归去。\n离别又春深，最恨也，多情飞絮。\n恨柳丝，系得离愁住，系不得离人住。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":949,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江城子·病起春尽","author":"夏完淳","text":"一帘病枕五更钟，晓云空，卷残红。\n无情春色，去矣几时逢？\n添我几行清泪也，留不住，苦匆匆。\n楚宫吴苑草茸茸，恋芳丛，绕游蜂。\n料得来年，相见画屏中。\n人自伤心花自笑，凭燕子，驾东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":950,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"两同心 有梦","author":"夏完淳","text":"梦到扬州，依然南浦。\n绮罗如梦锦如尘，香车宝马知何处。\n翠烟笼，十里隋堤，茫茫飞絮。\n举目魂消肠断，春光如许。\n琼花消息竟飘零，荒台古苑春无主。\n想莺花，十二楼前，迷离烟雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":951,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"婆罗门引 春尽夜","author":"夏完淳","text":"晚鸦飞去，一枝花影送黄昏。\n春归不阻重门。\n辞却江南三月，何处梦堪温？\n更阶前新绿，空锁芳尘。\n随风摇曳云。\n不须兰棹朱轮。\n只有梧桐枝上，留得三分。\n多情皓魄，怕明宵、还照旧钗痕。\n登楼望、柳外销魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":952,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋月","author":"徐有贞","text":"中秋月。\n月到中秋偏皎洁。\n偏皎洁，知他多少，阴晴圆缺。\n阴晴圆缺都休说。\n且喜人间好时节。\n好时节。\n愿得年年，常见中秋月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":953,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶见","author":"徐祯卿","text":"深山曲路见桃花，马上匆匆日欲斜。\n可奈玉鞭留不住，又衔春恨到天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":954,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王元章倒枝梅画","author":"徐渭","text":"皓态孤芳压俗姿，不堪复写拂云枝。\n从来万事嫌高格，莫怪梅花著地垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":955,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兰","author":"徐渭","text":"莫讶春光不属侬，一香巳足压千红。\n总令摘向韩娘袖，不作人间脑麝风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":956,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉人","author":"徐渭","text":"不去奔波办过年，终朝酩酊步颠连。\n几声街爆轰难醒，那怕人来索酒钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":957,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画梅 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"从来不见梅花谱，信手拈来自有神。\n不信试看千万树，东风吹著便成春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":958,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"葡萄 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"半生落魄巳成翁，独立书斋啸晚风。\n笔底明珠无处卖，閒抛閒掷野藤中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":959,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙丑元日大雪自饮至醉遂呼王山人过尚志家痛饮夜归复浮白于园中","author":"徐渭","text":"元日独酌不成酡，穿邻唤客雪中过。\n三百六旬又过矣，四十五春如老何。\n帻软渐知簪发少，兴豪那计酒筹多。\n小园风景偏宜雪，缀柳妆梅有许窠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":960,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮夜雪招二王诗人菲果小饮","author":"徐渭","text":"斗酒那能不醉休，醉来可使不歌不？\n黄金虽我无颜色，秋水还谁辨马牛？\n笑插落梅花乱鬓，起看城雪筋冰楼。\n一角忽风天尽黑，万鸦抟雨下枝头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":961,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳桥不知谁氏园旧有梨树六株花甚盛余每当月夜坐观移时拟买之屋而扁曰香雪园今归谁氏梨且斫尽矣","author":"徐渭","text":"六树梨花打百毬，昔年曾记柳桥头。\n娇来靥靥西施粉，冷伴年年燕子楼。\n不受三郎催羯鼓，好当一梦入罗浮。\n今来斫尽谁家圃，辜负山人扁额休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":962,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酒三品","author":"徐渭","text":"小瓮五双盏，千蚨五瓮香。\n无钱长买醉，有客偶携将。\n酝藉宜高价，淋漓想故乡。\n狭斜垆不少，今夜是谁当。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":963,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与言君饮酒","author":"徐渭","text":"今日与君饮一斗，卧龙山下人屠狗。\n雨歇苍鹰唤晚晴，浅草黄芽寒兔走。\n酒深耳热白日斛，笔满心雄不停手。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":964,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为郑先生题画四首值大醉 其三 群牛渡水无牧人","author":"徐渭","text":"春雨潇潇醉酒尊，何人命咏牧图浑。\n溪寒月落牛自渡，老牧醉眠何处村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":965,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兰亭次韵","author":"徐渭","text":"长堤高柳带平沙，无处春来不酒家。\n野外光风偏拂马，市门残帖解开花。\n新觞曲引诸溪水，旧寺岩垂几树茶。\n回首永和如昨日，不堪怅望晚天霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":966,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹","author":"徐渭","text":"一斗醉来将落日，胸中奇突有千尺。\n急索吴笺何太忙，兔起鹘落迟不得。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":967,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酒徒","author":"徐渭","text":"御史别淳于，金钗堕长夜。\n五斗不湿唇，双鬟抱垆泻。\n笑杀斗升肠，耳热索竿蔗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":968,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龛山凯歌六首（为吴县史鼎庵） 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"短剑随枪暮合围，寒风吹血着人飞。\n朝来道上看归骑，一片红冰冷铁衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":969,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得酒卮中有好花枝","author":"徐渭","text":"虽云辞树底，犹得映杯中。\n带叶蚁分绿，临妆脸并红。\n传时香觉迩，覆处影方空。\n若使玻璃杯，楼台浸几重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":970,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"频婆","author":"徐渭","text":"石密偷将结，他鸡伏不成。\n千林黄鹄卵，一市楚江萍。\n旨夺秋厨腊，鲜专夏盌冰。\n上元灯火节，一颗百钱青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":971,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔家四图四首","author":"徐渭","text":"渔伴网鱼换酒，渔妇把酒斟翁。\n邻舍不离水上，对斟只在波中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":972,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万空歌","author":"悟空","text":"天也空，地也空，人生渺渺在其中。\n日也空，月也空，东升西落为谁功？\n金也空，银也空，死后何曾在手中！\n妻也空，子也空，黄泉路上不相逢！\n权也空，名也空，转眼荒郊土一封！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":973,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大堤女","author":"袁宏道","text":"文窗斜对木香篱，胡粉薄施细作眉。\n贪向墙头看车马，不知裙著刺花儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":974,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上见数渔舟为公卒所窘 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"钓竿拂晓霜，衣薄芦花絮。\n一亩不籍官，也被官差去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":975,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"雪里山茶取次红。\n白头孀妇哭春风。\n自从貂虎横行后，十室金钱九室空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":976,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花雨","author":"袁宏道","text":"浅碧深红大半残，恶风催雨剪刀寒。\n桃花不比杭州女，洗却胭脂不耐看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":977,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"文殊台","author":"袁宏道","text":"芙蓉万尺花如铁，秋窗昼洒红霞屑。\n螺顶仙人骑杖来，天衣晓带雪山雪。\n帝遣神丁量海洗，绣锷斑棱生平砥。\n一萍吹作浔阳城，半七疏为九江水。\n高青直上一万重，绿瞳笑启金泥封。\n烟重云骨不可去，怒鞭白雀恼张公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":978,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西陵桥","author":"袁宏道","text":"西陵桥，水长在。\n松叶细如针，不肯结罗带。\n莺如衫，燕如钗。\n油壁车，斫为柴。\n青骢马，自西来。\n昨日树头花，今朝陌上土。\n恨血与啼魂，一半逐风雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":979,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"显灵宫集诸公以城市山林为韵 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"野花遮眼酒沾涕，塞耳愁听新朝事。\n邸报束作一筐灰，朝衣典与栽花市。\n新诗日日千馀言，诗中无一忧民字。\n旁人道我真聩聩，口不能荅指山翠。\n自从老杜得诗名，忧君爱国成儿戏。\n言既无庸嘿不可，阮家那得不沉醉。\n眼底浓浓一杯春，恸于洛阳年少泪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":980,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻省城急报","author":"袁宏道","text":"黄鹄矶头红染泪，手杀都堂如儿戏。\n飞鞚叠骑尘碾尘，报书一夕三回至。\n天子圣明臣敛手，胸臆决尽天下事。\n二百年来好纪纲，辰裂星纷委平地。\n天长阍永叫不闻，健马那堪持朽辔。\n书生痛哭倚蒿篱，有钱难买青山翠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":981,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"擢歌行","author":"袁宏道","text":"妾家白蘋洲，随风作乡土。\n弄篙如弄针，不曾拈一缕。\n四月鱼苗风，随君到巴东。\n十月洗河水，送君发杨子。\n杨子波势恶，无风浪亦作。\n江深得鱼难，鸬鹚充糕臛。\n生子若凫雏，穿江复入湖。\n长时剪荷叶，与儿作衣襦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":982,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"横塘渡","author":"袁宏道","text":"横塘渡，临水步。\n郎西来，妾东去。\n妾非倡家人，红楼大姓妇。\n吹花误唾郎，感郎千金顾。\n妾家住虹桥，朱门十字路。\n认取辛夷花，莫过杨梅树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":983,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己未九日对菊大醉戏作四首（洪武十二年） 其一","author":"袁凯","text":"老夫爱此黄金蕊，儿子须将白酒赊。\n直到残阳下天去，更添灯火照欹斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":984,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京师得家书","author":"袁凯","text":"江水三千里，家书十五行。\n行行无别语，只道早还乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":985,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白燕 其一","author":"袁凯","text":"故国飘零事已非，旧时王谢见应稀。\n月明汉水初无影，雪满梁园尚未归。\n柳絮池塘香入梦，梨花庭院冷侵衣。\n赵家姊妹多相忌，莫向昭阳殿里飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":986,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临刑口占","author":"袁崇焕","text":"一生事业总成空，半世功名在梦中。\n死后不愁无勇将，忠魂依旧守辽东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":987,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过诃林寺口占","author":"袁崇焕","text":"四十年来过半身，望中祇树隔红尘。\n如今著足空王地，多了从前学杀人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":988,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山海关送季弟南还二首 其二","author":"袁崇焕","text":"弟兄于汝倍关情，此日临歧感慨生。\n磊落丈夫谁好剑，牢骚男子尔能兵。\n才堪逐电三驱捷，身上飞鹏一羽轻。\n行负乡邦重努力，莫耽疏懒堕时名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":989,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山海关送季弟南还二首 其一","author":"袁崇焕","text":"公车犹记昔年情，万里从戎塞上征。\n牧圉此时犹捍御，驰驱何日慰升平。\n由来友爱钟吾辈，肯把须眉负此生。\n去住安危俱莫问，燕然曾勒古人名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":990,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题","author":"袁崇焕","text":"记得相逢一笑迎，亲承指教夜谈兵。\n才兼文武无余子，功到雄奇即罪名。\n慷慨裂眦须欲动，模糊热血面如生。\n背人痛极为私祭，洒泪深宵哭失声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":991,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题","author":"袁崇焕","text":"太息弓藏狗又烹，狐悲兔死最关情。\n家贫资罄身难赎，贿赂公行杀有名。\n脱帻愤深檀道济，爰书冤及魏元成。\n备遭惨毒缘何事，想为登场善用兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":992,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归庾岭","author":"袁崇焕","text":"功名劳十载，心迹渐依违。\n忍说还山是，难言出塞非。\n主恩天地重，臣遇古今稀。\n数卷封章外，浑然旧日归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":993,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边中送别","author":"袁崇焕","text":"五载离家别路悠，送君寒浸宝刀头。\n欲知肺腑同生死，何用安危问去留。\n策杖只因图雪耻，横戈原不为封侯。\n故园亲侣如相问，愧我边尘尚未收。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":994,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"话别秦六郎","author":"袁崇焕","text":"海鳄波鲸夜不啾，故人谈剑剡溪头。\n言深夜半犹疑昼，酒冷凉生始觉秋。\n水国芙蓉低睡月，江湄杨柳软维舟。\n自怜作赋非王粲，戛玉鸣金有少游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":995,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南还别陈翼所总戎","author":"袁崇焕","text":"慷慨同雠日，间关百战时。\n功高明主眷，心苦后人知。\n麋鹿还山便，麒麟绘阁宜。\n去留都莫讶，秋草正离离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":996,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偕诸将游海岛","author":"袁崇焕","text":"战守逶迤不自由，偏因胜地重深愁。\n荣华我已知庄梦，忠愤人将谓杞忧。\n边衅久开终是定，室戈方操几时休。\n片云孤月应肠断，椿树凋零又一秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":997,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田家夜舂","author":"高启","text":"新妇春粮独睡迟，夜寒茅屋雨来时。\n灯前每嘱儿休哭，明日行人要早炊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":998,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"回文","author":"高启","text":"风帘一烛对残花，薄雾寒笼翠袖纱。\n空院别愁惊破梦，东阑井树夜啼鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":999,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寻胡隐君","author":"高启","text":"渡水复渡水，看花还看花。\n春风江上路，不觉到君家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1000,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红叶","author":"高启","text":"霜染满林红，萧疏夕照中。\n曾供写秋怨，流出上阳宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1001,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园中梨花唯开一枝","author":"高启","text":"栏外见春迟，朝来雪一枝。\n不知初发处，误道已残时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1002,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋前芭蕉","author":"高启","text":"静绕绿阴行，闲听雨声卧。\n还有感秋诗，窗前书叶破。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1003,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中忆二女","author":"高启","text":"每忆门前两候归，客中长夜梦魂飞。\n料应此际犹依母，灯下看缝寄我衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1004,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫女图","author":"高启","text":"女奴扶醉踏苍苔，明月西园侍宴回。\n小犬隔花空吠影，夜深宫禁有谁来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1005,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳燕","author":"高启","text":"妙舞汉宫人，香魂化几春。\n娇飞傍杨柳，犹似学腰身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1006,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"背面美人图","author":"高启","text":"欲呼回首不知名，背立东风几许情。\n莫道画师元不见，倾城虽见画难成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1007,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻雁","author":"高启","text":"江寒月黑夜，定宿蒹葭里。\n叫叫过灯前，却是谁惊起？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1008,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得家书","author":"高启","text":"未读书中语，忧怀已觉宽。\n灯前看封箧，题字有平安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1009,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惜春","author":"高启","text":"春过一半未能知，此后还愁不肯迟。\n斜日浮云楼上醉，更无言语嗅花枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1010,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观鹅","author":"高启","text":"交睡春塘暖，苹香日欲曛。\n嫩怜黄似酒，净爱白如云。\n击乱思常侍，笼归忆右军。\n沧波堪远泛，莫入野凫群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1011,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]